The '''Inyusu Tor mineral processing facility''',<ref name="Battlefront" /> also known as the '''Inyusu Tor refinery complex''',<ref name="Rebel Files">''[[Star Wars: The Rebel Files]]''</ref> was located at the top of the [[Volcano|volcanic]] mountain [[Inyusu Tor]] on the [[planet]] [[Sullust]]. In [[3 ABY]], it was captured by the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]]'s [[61st Mobile Infantry]], who were unable to leave Sullust after their [[Thunderstrike|transport]] was shot down. They defended it from the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] forces on Sullust and came out victorious.<ref name="Battlefront" />

